{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1252,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e985fdad08ed89dc10b76e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73232b7e1974fad800e7f765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托你\r\n手下留情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40712406319daac77f76916d8e8e048d72bd95d57c95db188c089fa7be87c98b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b345b401adb715d25e2aab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了……！\r\n还请再多多展现给我看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ceedb495e55f19beda06dba9fd920f5b8b56e79d1e9e5c6c0fefb381182b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fb10a71b1fbd13dcdbea65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n今天也要好好地\r\n行善积德喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a22f24eaf3ee1e633c0c25bc778a9bc4379eb3ad7d2a28ea1b1e5b512a6b096a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4150cdb8bba3d1ca64b86973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天早上也在速子醒来前\r\n就离开宿舍了！\r\n因为我不想在早晨打扰到我的推嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "024fe697583d8d3d42889f91effddca12afb01421128d63181425dcb717484ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be5bd2349923d5dde0c1d083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好！今天是个超棒的赛马娘\r\n好日子呢～♪我要完全隐藏气息，\r\n把自己变成一堵墙喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a35bb1a95db6d013e0a1b611d79d9d0f68ff74227ec8099aee2587dc4f1785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89a3d30dd50038c1cf974c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呼～！现在食堂中\r\n挤满了赛马娘……！\r\n我稍微去偷看一下好了……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f99443c11faaf937fc40f086d929f958b4d5f444db01a491498ae0b849fc21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cec0eee2772c2b2b6748e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了，已经天黑了。\r\n我们阿宅的本领\r\n要从现在开始才会发挥出来喔～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e115e9538e0cde50266eadc149a3f4629be709d68720c03daf1edfbcfd66f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efff64c7d67b507ff784100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做的事实在太多了。\r\n查看社交平台加上观赏比赛影片，\r\n还要画薄……咳，创作活动之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6b275b9b916925c2e37b1e79c9edee3188b394b192a2b49b5d7e717b525a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33079ac3bcec77adb2f6bd6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就想到……没错，赛马娘！\r\n当那女孩为自己拿掉头上的花瓣，\r\n那瞬间……两人的故事就此展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "652a49b38d56562300e7f3935eb68522ddf62eaa3994f03b6649ee68818adf07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:815715e470cab09b98736c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天是赛马娘的季节！\r\n跟那女孩借饮料瓶来喝了一口，\r\n那瞬间……两人的命运开始转动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0b2c0f393a741562fc36bed1f307eba6ea474b45b286fc7956da898c9f6ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3e1f0295d676dc5b08e9f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天风情的代表就会想到赛马娘！\r\n在夕阳之下，那女孩微笑的瞬间……\r\n世界只属于她们两人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad6b1cba6ea044982be0563e1f45c41e419882588be1c836a393b1c96309d0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:225d35ba0e92da0c33517c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天果然就会想到赛马娘！\r\n虽是离别的季节，但那女孩说了\r\n要在一起……两人的故事将继续下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ceb193a4af4dc3ccceff5d11c999e12a2a080a2624e494590584403f96e99e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ffdf665f8961bb4953a4763",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "殭尸原本就很怕早上的太阳了，\r\n要是又被赛马娘早上的笑脸照耀，\r\n那我不就会……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd4cbadddc204db0b6f9d7035bbf1b7fa0acb7dd4eb29ca2372ff7483aafc7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20520f38f9fcbb9b4ef779a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～我熬夜涉猎了各种殭尸作品，\r\n真是深奥呀～我还挺喜欢这种\r\n很夸张的设定喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "194ee8e8be7730f585ea8359b408b2c86815a85866a60aedbf80c6f938b86ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abadeb1373bbf3b4f850f524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到处都是赛马娘的学园──\r\n这里的空气就是阿宅殭尸的主食！\r\n我要享用午餐了！（吸气～～）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10c1769efdc11e87e153b4e51bb34a359e52084db521c3a7ba84d9c4f5bbca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a9686e112550a11ea42d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同志，志同道合的道士！帮、帮我\r\n贴上符咒！看到互相喂食的赛马娘\r\n让我兴奋到极限MAX啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6873923790d323f7ffcbd83d3487fd65801decf1b983c8bac7205b7fa7ac9bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a3f35c11e59fb02ac7ea2c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，夜晚来临啰！\r\n殭尸跟阿宅都会在夜晚活动！\r\n创作，开始────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761ff905edd7d86ea3a8752c9f25ca82b3166bfbbab697a82703b6db36b4d20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2aa764452304f537efa71a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然道士拿出铜钱剑要击退殭尸，\r\n那我就用散发七色光芒的剑\r\n来与之对抗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f728ec7e79ec9b8d0a1984a17d6d1771cd9fcea9e31d88438be3fc39fca6f84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285c32076b843936292c4089",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～！闪亮亮的赛马娘新生！\r\n我明明该迎接她们到来，\r\n却好像要被接去天国了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb47ac99b6b87275a0091df1ae9f297562a9ece210ef3d54bd6c7cd628a67d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25fcdbedae47518291f8ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "满头大汗害符咒都黏在脸上了……\r\n但没办法……这可是看到赛马娘\r\n令人兴奋的夏日模样而流的汗水！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a3054bb91edb90cd0f36d154aadd0990acbcd6e0788d377502993eb27a9cb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413f015c1d16ae26fe579274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲之秋来临了呢，呜嘻嘻……\r\n来去尽情吸取只有从赛马娘身上\r\n才摄取得到的营养吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aaf2444d2b3c532829a3efe21cf65dee3b724a75fc48e188011456ca9d64d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4cf6e4fcf9a24faf53aa296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了猫熊造型包子。\r\n但我比较想好好欣赏赛马娘\r\n大口享用猫熊包子的光景说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9871e7303053727c8789062c04351bff103911fc12bc0c4a3bcccefe1700adb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a96b24367000c0011c71c5aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662e748f176f0df85df64427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebfb177fbce71c9a1e86c79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么时候去演唱会，\r\n飞鹰子总是笑着对我挥手……\r\n难道她是神？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a932d23b4a3debc6e6f9677c703ae127a52cf0ad2ec67c48ef958058e9a575ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7eae432b9553ce3e57ce40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为父亲工作的关系，\r\n我可以轻松拿到想要的书。\r\n……啊，当然是正规管道咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a99d81c6a7850c7d94b8fe7937e8835c121b6b3b983a9fb772578e40e76420c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2814699209b43bfb32f47dea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好歌剧牵起怒涛的手\r\n走向赛道！？这这这样的画面，\r\n真的可以免费让我看吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c782cd03602272102e25998057f02d5e893166d01635a3c23a314c50a4b114b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d10b39432af071a0eb34297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在募集能隐藏气息的方法！\r\n想看的是我的推最自然的一面，\r\n但好像老是会让对方感受到视线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f301a129d55005437203e2be09c71c71345c4970307dceb3ae1acb2b26c08dc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6251b1e7b21c45c115cd993e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇～～转车要十五分钟！？\r\n那可不行，会赶不上后半场的活动！\r\n该怎么做……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d370b9de1b73cf808fe7cfe206d16fd7446bf320e36a6204b14d650e5650b68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da68767bf982957d5856048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……！跟我的推她们一样的\r\n服装……！我会好好对待它，\r\n不让它出现丝毫损伤……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8576b795024e7ab3a9ffc635339ff98bb1fec589fb913660fb29134f0c4c8d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9def42ca0b2d490c9e4857e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然要站在舞台上给我的推看，\r\n怎么会有这种幸福的事！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8dc1d3b8243653fd31bba472bd33645a95f97093f94ec73c077155e2f15bb68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de2df4fefe2f4b1e9b66ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样……？为了让自己\r\n站在我的推身边不显失礼，\r\n在设计上已经尽力做到最好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "865402a77edf1e3178269941bbd8fa6f71208a052f0b5c710ca0c82b1a90032c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db761a6f148bbd573eb410e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢这种感觉的服装──\r\n呃，那个，被那样一直盯着看，\r\n我会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "138139823ec5a85db6d83963306dcefd205bc285821f414f9015d4899a93872c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ca2a61bb73cc193a51a0448",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会吧，从宿舍到学校这么短的距离\r\n居然要一起走过来……！这还真是\r\n……其中一定有什么内情吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b87c38711d6751028dca459fb05ba33fe27f7019d8e9532160fe92d8af26d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394979425eda22b7d695361a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面带笑容吃下胡萝卜面包的\r\n乌拉拉……我永远都看不腻……\r\n喜欢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d16ec7b4685e5f133cf34b4be283dcd869998d3b9dae3d502bd7fbafe959a0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aba9a839e0fc565ae328114f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞお手柔らかに\r\nお願いします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c41b816a3a353d35944cb616f8f088a72f7feefd5a7985c4efb3e033a27aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce03334628cbb63071b2340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶又更新了UG！？\r\n好辛苦，被我的推这么频繁地喂养，\r\n实在太尊太辛苦了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7565beb350243b159beb9c1e146ee2f50d670ff094417089784a25dd2364c90e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1582d35bdefae70846f05dcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵♪这季节充满\r\n我喜欢的大型比赛呢～\r\n我连一场都不会错过喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "675d72700a0c1720978bf86f1d967361c06d1b3f20bb71f5b8dcdfc96e09b614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ee19f3a93bc1b859f8edd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些活动的事需要你\r\n帮我一点忙……你对体力\r\n有自信吗？很耐热吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f115a9743d326febb9bb3b571faa608d48cd28b553c333ca649c728ead7da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26cb226cee81bdf41a1186a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大型比赛也很赞，\r\n但我很在意出道战的结果耶～\r\n今年到底是什么人胜出？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa759030b0f160607a986380efe112272fdab9af9f863a770a6257b157fa588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cbd9118ba84e2352a5527b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，刚才戴着柔软面罩的\r\n赛马娘……毛茸茸的……\r\n真是太可爱……我不行了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c701f9a127ea19133d1b9d412f8692083ac654d527234fede50d516bdad81e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e077d99b6c42936abfc19517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差点跌倒的怒涛，\r\n跟有如跳舞般出手相助的好歌剧……\r\n啊啊……谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62919989b616852cc4c4e8b1f36f3eff4d1938c534ef04491a81039b9b65b865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0763f58dcc5bf07779a9cb7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳跟善信两位散发的阳气，\r\n对我来说太过刺激了……！\r\n可是我好喜翻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87f96afd8ea5700a8879f71e6a6692d58e5dae78626161f54e492595890d1cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129e4436efe9f5ff9695d2a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历奇看到殭尸时反应很大……\r\n还说要为我开办一对一风水讲座……\r\n蛤？根本天使吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c253479ffb5c15f089091b198425bd67808e528a21f2043ee0bba28496e85de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fa94d6acbccc35d974b49e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被尊到倒下，再被尊到复活……\r\n我们这些阿宅，\r\n或许生来就是殭尸也说不定呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08813be580d434df27dd183445e51f7aa785af564b2cbe8d7a9c9796dbac65d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64811ed80a190e4444b4a2bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前速子正在研究如何重现\r\n殭尸如钢铁般强韧的肉体。\r\n她那认真的神情我好喜翻……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b2c7913b9e0bbb175e34d081c156250f42a0847fcb1085ae7f0c49505549e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd318c9037ce3c8c28e4f8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨是很多怪物的弱点……然而！\r\n阿宅殭尸不能就此倒下！\r\n上学的景色、晨跑……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c505c1dfbcfd573e91afcc8b26b0e9948454644db06e330e92ff7af8fe054692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23948c1561ed689043f16dff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在大白天穿着这身打扮\r\n会非常显眼……无法藏身于\r\n背景之中了！大危机！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c13e759702cb704e2beda06ac4de0812ec56d64d991293e660582648e906100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38cba79981c3aeb6ec38fe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了夜晚在外面行走时不去吓到\r\n赛马娘们，我都非常小心谨慎！\r\n绝对不能造成困扰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d309b64112f0e1d3b3359e2dac4e11a07c25051f0d354ac35d65ac47c475f035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df46ea2d860ccd58c552c675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙赛马娘亲口称赞「这套衣服\r\n好有春天气息！」……呜，采用\r\n大面积粉红色实在太好了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d2c85c8b7ccf13a425dc3e868f2e1d52f27bd862d06c5bdfa8636109c457f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70cded791bae03bf12ed487f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿成这样我也不热喔～\r\n想知道我这经历过无数战场的勇者\r\n都是如何预防中暑的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d7553ee043156a53b86900ef05e8430d2bc2d6c7db8060b3e330791460c438",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478e73de5d89fb6089b366fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不必给我点心没关系！我只想阅读\r\n你那充满赛马娘之爱的作品！\r\n可以跟我交换吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc95bd654e38062d1d3a30dfa3787828b49208a80391b21e41fec638c205f47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:882f71006dc1307d61e07c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说殭尸会从嘴巴吐出寒气……\r\n如果不要一次吐太多，不就能尽情\r\n欣赏赛马娘们互相依偎的景色了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43764149c2044ea1ca0127795c679b92c9c2bf2f8cb6d4414ad36a2c3448988c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db48cd0e7424b95221d8d791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的推都对这个猫熊布贴\r\n赞不绝口……我好庆幸自己有\r\n制作周边的能力啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ac1542f1fbd1ea330325e7799aced50e5a75434fc6ae657e85ad1bda9c50af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8013609b72f4794bc7889e5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我原先很烦恼该注重恐怖还是\r\n可爱……最后决定打造一个因为\r\n对赛马娘的爱而迷失自我的怪物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee3163a712bca216d4457d37ed6d4f84c273f872ec6722dc9c35e58232fe19e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e602f018cd19102643ec71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，想怎么训练就照做吧！\r\n我会尽全力完成的喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ec5595c0601c5abc97106f8f7939acf02e825a5eebf51181b27c5c4ba40050f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b220ed6d6c3033e6c3ad3cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7dd06046cf1e8ad84a1afc5546f403c10f2ce77811987d52a2bd31d1a5ebe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858b0eeb3708df02fd04ad6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个要这样子，这个要那样子……\r\n唔呵呵，假想训练无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34bd87861bb3bd27bd30c5d8e20a5749d2a549d8b9124a7113d73b2fd73f2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ccf4e36340eefa1b020fe90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，今天我的推也很尊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7b1f1d852f46e023e41e4780a16e6f12e60265b1b306b656470a8b90f19b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f586ecaeb54af0c912a78087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到究竟有多少赛马娘\r\n曾经通过这里……\r\n──真让人受不了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56ae0fa4fc969b299ee16818a8843bf11a3a214b060698e5764ba83419791f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16ae0facc81070d92988f02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "古代的哲学家有云：\r\n「所谓的爱，比起被爱，\r\n更该去爱人」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "160b28f7a0d76738a7198829783d7f3453ccddf0cd4df058f954a1676030b9c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9137805e5eeda1e251c81304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「仰之弥高，\r\n钻之弥坚」──\r\n……赛马娘也是这样呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea197a471bf81eb493ce0da5b3a471b8fea5d88227cae4a2758003c014b15cfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda107ca6517defad58e078a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「如果推了右边的女孩，左边的也要\r\n一起推。」古代的伟人是这么说的！\r\n来吧！我已有决心要支持所有人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98df5919fd6abd108661cc2a178eea686ea8446bbf0a494f5b8c8e0b9eb12d52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de313ad3539f19e683dd3b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……！！\r\n有一堆穿泳装的赛马娘……！！\r\n活着真好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8e713d1551f88ad48371272bb7bf9322c2fed90e084e7c77c9a9e8318615d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f9e2fc7fc7e9cf4f40902c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同志……志同道合的道士。\r\n对我下命令吧。\r\n本殭尸会听从你的所有命令！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef040c9b4b3d9f2fe828ced291a9bddb67c71d828c743f049da116eb571609f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dc4a703273533e0721d193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细想想，\r\n两手高举在前方跳跃前进，\r\n这运动量满大的呢～呼～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28f7b351244e892d07b3650e40e84ceca2953ac27cf9f06724cca05bed28237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48841644922ee8263f6b89a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "汗水淋漓挥洒青春的赛马娘！\r\n一想到这种画面\r\n就会忍不住兴奋地蹦蹦跳啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d64eea9c415751f7f73464ae8cf415fd1a1e7bf11ebcbcbe4faede5b6478946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad1b394d5f12fc05057e7b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身怀怪力、身手矫捷，并同时拥有\r\n一颗炙热之心的阿宅殭尸是\r\n毫无死角的！尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb9aea401ee4b75d3aef78ec2d35be873f536109bc23c3949682b88ac047581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:338fd356d783f5d0ef7bceef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问～你对角色扮演有兴趣吗……\r\n没有啦，其实要我独自参加\r\n也是可以啦～也是可以啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e0806d849bae17cd43d4f9f7fff57e4834254933a83c3a7aac60314e905ba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:782f0891e0355a9f3f98f9df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道士，我相信你，这些符咒\r\n就交给你了……我开始失控时\r\n请立刻封印住我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbe1f3b66f24ddf67cbd3f48094825dea0ef217e81d8ced54f060838f040f4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2517812101d44fea4ca5fdef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有同志才能与我共享\r\n并控制这狂野的灵魂！\r\n今天也卯足全力加油吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7021ee66477d9e53cff8b419943a7d90fb5f56e1750dd93e64ece33a50d62be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec445ca0a4f1bfe0423a8fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你才是赛马娘大师！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29aac99d49d41e5ea33f8af9c5fae8ecc98c59cc2b4e44c048183830b34ff31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb43be91a14b79f310244aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段非常密集又充实的时光～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaef34eeae6acadf361d97afd76e6593b0cefb1f008cf8a42286ca586f800d91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a46cc9fceb8005f81b8fab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道士与阿宅殭尸！根本最佳拍檔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac346be845a2d443e9b465fae56a8c0e7d04d4d1694e59423051fe2196f295d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b42ca9c5884dbd36dc6d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢……！万分感谢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1c169d1f5a21c67971e68611b61fbf248a2da1dfd21ce0c063841c5e5428b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b1f7e67a4030f734dd52103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级要提升了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b35bc605ac3828dec1183bfae73017302599ce6df38aa7bd85991338b417e56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ec93059371b72a2958ed328",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了我的推！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df0ad6721d75c0cd825edb03dd6706ab80b4b336544d73b199d3d73b4dd71b7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:115dd8302139e242db1748c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，我是爱丽数码！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7e077841cc0927c36062aa5a024a6b8ad7e0011f77229aa9769603ee539e10b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155810040fe04b8f4c2bb8de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了感受我的推，\r\n不管要跑过草地还是沙土都愿意！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5921faa580f0367d68d282c3734ddd2f22ead0be59644f8c7443cc9c0dad86dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1019",
        "95004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
